b03dab2-e566-5865-9f77-2bea261f8203" :question/math-academy-id "q-105526" :question/problem "$$\n{{[\\begin{aligned}3 & 7 & -1 \\\\ 3 & -3 & 6 \\\\ 3 & 7 & -4\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{A}={{[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{L}\\cdot {{[\\begin{aligned}3 & 7 & -1 \\\\ 0 & -10 & 7 \\\\ 0 & 0 & \\boxed{}\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{U}.\n$$\n\nConsider the LU factorization of the matrix $A$ above. What is the value of ${u}_{33}$ in the matrix $U?$" :question/worked-solution "The matrix $U$ in the LU decomposition is obtained from the original matrix $A$ by row-reducing using Gaussian elementation. In particular, to make zeros below the main diagonal, we proceed as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =[\\begin{aligned}3 & 7 & -1 \\\\ 3 & -3 & 6 \\\\ 3 & 7 & -4\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-1){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}3 & 7 & -1 \\\\ 0 & -10 & 7 \\\\ 3 & 7 & -4\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+(-1){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}3 & 7 & -1 \\\\ 0 & -10 & 7 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -3\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, ${u}_{33}=-3.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-105526/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "c159d750-ab1f-538b-b8cc-ae66ef1ae414"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-105526"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-106959/selection/6f82224f8b1ee97008b91a10e1637541369c9ae3c9740f689318662a702b261d" :answer/id #uuid "78c5f47f-8c4e-5f3f-9a1d-53bbcf848a64" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0,\\,-4,\\,-5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-106959/selection/14a85c6cd7e3d24b2c9450fa9fc899ebe8eb2f255c31d249811c7aadeae9d66a" :answer/id #uuid "f5962a53-6001-5f14-ae00-95a3aaa5775f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0,\\,-4,\\,3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-106959/selection/fd47eb7fabcea75022cd435935b5842fbf644be7ae17ec86424c39193e453968" :answer/id #uuid "c028d017-e0e7-57b